      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-112702",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the relationship between $x$ and $y$ shown below.\n\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $y$ | $5$ | $7$ | $9$ | $11$ |\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. The relationship between $x$ and $y$ is linear\n2. The relationship between $x$ and $y$ is exponential\n3. If $x$ is increased by $1$ then $y$ increases by $2$"
