      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-45467",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the relationship between $t$ and $w$ shown below.\n\n| $t$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $w$ | $\\frac{1}{3}$ | $1$ | $3$ | $9$ |\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. The relationship between $t$ and $w$ is linear\n2. The relationship between $t$ and $w$ is exponential\n3. If $t$ is increased by $1$, then $w$ increases by a factor of $3$"
